# Audiotool

- Browser OAuth2 **PKCE** only. Never a personal access token or secret client credential.
- Keep integration behind `$lib/audiotool` adapter; UI calls the adapter, not Nexus directly.
- `@audiotool/nexus` is **not** installed until an intentional Phase 0 spike.
- Stub `connectAudiotool` / `uploadSample` must keep failing clearly until wired.
- Local audio stays on-device until upload reports ready; do not claim background upload after tab close.
- Redirect URL must match dashboard exactly — local uses `http://127.0.0.1:5173/...`.
- Details: `docs/audiotool-integration.md`.
